{"timestamp":"2026-10-20T07:19:56.140Z","ordinal":10665,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a1582e-5deb-7d73-9921-c6f99001581d","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Project D — Omega Attempt 3: Authorized Publication\n\nI authorize committing the seven verified Attempt 3 files,\nfast-forwarding main, and pushing main to GitHub.\n\nCurrent improvement branch: omega/project-d-attempt-3\nExpected original main:\n653eec28484f601d6568dc55bf7b3db955dd2ce0\n\n1. Verify the branch, working tree, and GitHub main.\n   Stop if unexpected changes exist.\n\n\n2. Review and stage ONLY these seven files:\n   README.md\n   skills/travel-expense-claim/SKILL.md\n   src/travel_claim/cli.py\n   src/travel_claim/outputs.py\n   src/travel_claim/receipt_continuation.py\n   src/travel_claim/repair_continuation.py\n   tests/test_repair_continuation.py\n\n3. Confirm the final verification remains valid:\n   - 589 tests passed\n   - 53/53 published evidence hashes preserved\n   - Historical files and original Git history unchanged\n\n4. Commit with the existing Entire hooks enabled.\n   Do not bypass or rewrite Entire history.\n\n5. Fast-forward main to the improvement commit.\n   Never force-push, reset, rebase, or squash.\n\n6. Push ONLY main to origin using a normal push.\n\n7. Verify:\n   - Local main and remote main match\n   - Original main remains an ancestor\n   - All 30 previous Entire checkpoint refs remain intact\n   - New Entire checkpoint is remotely published\n   - Any queued or finalized Entire transcript tail is\n     handled through normal Entire mechanisms only\n   - Tracked working tree is clean\n\n8. Report the new commit SHA, Entire checkpoint ID,\n   test results, remote verification, and any blockers.\n\nSTOP if an Entire synchronization or preservation check\nfails. Do not invent a workaround.\n\nDo not submit to Classroom, deploy, or perform unrelated work.\n\nReturn the publication report and stop."}],"internal_chat_message